  "memories": [
    {
      "id": "m-20250216-0",
      "key": "mem_20250216_0",
      "day": "20250216",
      "text": "You wrote Anne that you will come before Mid-Lent Sunday. The sheet waits for the carrier of the 27th.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250216/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250216",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250216#meeting_104000_720",
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250216#meeting_121500_720",
          "sol://facets/stratford/activities/20250216#note_153000_600"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250218-1",
      "key": "mem_20250218_1",
      "day": "20250218",
      "text": "Sincler has the half-line, slower, and then nothing. Sam kept the notes and lost the place.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250218/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250218",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250218#frame_090500_240",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250218#meeting_091500_720",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250218#meeting_102000_720"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250219-2",
      "key": "mem_20250219_2",
      "day": "20250219",
      "text": "Alse has never seen a play. She heard the oath and asked who cooks.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250219/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250219",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250219#meeting_092000_720",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250219#frame_160000_240",
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250219#meeting_203000_720"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250220-3",
      "key": "mem_20250220_3",
      "day": "20250220",
      "text": "The boxes held seven pound eleven, and the yard went out quiet. At supper you heard Southwell was condemned and asked when it was to be. The answer was tomorrow.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250220/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250220",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250220#meeting_091500_720",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250220#photo_120000_120",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250220#frame_122000_240"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250221-4",
      "key": "mem_20250221_4",
      "day": "20250221",
      "text": "Three accounts of the hanging came before supper, and they did not match. You stayed in.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250221/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250221",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250221#meeting_123000_720",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250221#frame_160000_180",
          "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250221#memo_211500_120"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "m-20250222-5",
      "key": "mem_20250222_5",
      "day": "20250222",
      "text": "The share is thirty shillings. At home you counted the coffer and wrote the share.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "briefing",
        "uri": "sol://chronicle/20250222/talents/morning_briefing",
        "briefing_day": "20250222",
        "refs": [
          "sol://facets/household/activities/20250222#meeting_084000_720",
          "sol://facets/stratford/activities/20250222#frame_110000_180",
          "sol://facets/company/activities/20250222#frame_152000_240"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "said": [
    {
      "id": "s-20250216-0",
      "key": "said_20250216_0",
      "day": "20250216",
      "quote": "They get the last word, which is a colder portion, and a better one.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/household/activities/20250216#meeting_121500_720"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250217-1",
      "key": "said_20250217_1",
      "day": "20250217",
      "quote": "A tally of a rehearsal is a tally of air.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/company/activities/20250217#meeting_091000_720"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250218-2",
      "key": "said_20250218_2",
      "day": "20250218",
      "quote": "Slower in. Then nothing. Let them do it.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/company/activities/20250218#meeting_102000_720"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250219-3",
      "key": "said_20250219_3",
      "day": "20250219",
      "quote": "She heard the oath and asked who cooks.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250219#memo_211000_120"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250220-4",
      "key": "said_20250220_4",
      "day": "20250220",
      "quote": "I am glad of the quiet. I am not going to explain it.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/company/activities/20250220#meeting_163500_720"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250221-5",
      "key": "said_20250221_5",
      "day": "20250221",
      "quote": "They hanged the Jesuit this morning. Southwell. I did not go. \u2026I was never going.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250221#memo_211500_120"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250221-6",
      "key": "said_20250221_6",
      "day": "20250221",
      "quote": "I was thinking of the voice. How long a voice may stay in words when the mouth is stopped. That is a fine thought, and so I distrust it a little.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250221#memo_211500_120"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s-20250221-7",
      "key": "said_20250221_7",
      "day": "20250221",
      "quote": "I have been holding this pen all the while. There's no ink in it.",
      "source": {
        "kind": "activity",
        "uri": "sol://facets/writing/activities/20250221#memo_211500_120"
      }
    }
  ]
}
